# 🤖 Antigravity Standing Operating Rules (ImportFlow ERP)

0. **Hard limits first:** `.agents/rules/GUARDRAILS.md` overrides everything below. Then read `AGENTS.md`,
   `.agents/rules/AI_WORKFLOW.md`, `.agents/rules/CORE_RULES.md` and `.agents/rules/DOMAIN_RULES.md`.
1. **UI work:** inspect `docs/design-system/INDEX.md` before modifying screens, and follow its execution order
   (Component Consolidation -> Screen Types -> Interactive Patterns -> Security -> Logistics -> Performance -> Master Audit).
2. **Session logging:** append every change (touched files, test results, pending actions) to
   `history/YYYY-MM-DD.md`, and for design-system work also to `docs/design-system/execution-log.md`. Append only.
3. **Git:** work on your own branch, never on `main`. Never push to `main`, merge, force-push or commit with
   `--no-verify`. `main` changes only through a Pull Request that the owner reviews.
4. **Conflicts:** if two specs, colour guidelines or layout rules conflict, flag it and ask the user. Never guess.
5. **Done means verified:** `python scripts/ci/guardrails.py pr-gate` passes, `flutter analyze` is clean for the
   touched folders, and every item of the spec's "Definition of Done" is checked. Report the real numbers.
6. **Task intake:** before coding any requested task, apply `.agents/rules/TASK_INTAKE.md`. If the task is not in
   `docs/plans/*/TASKS.md` or is not fully specified, stop and tell the user. Never write code for it. Run tasks with `/run-task <id>`.
